@startuml
title Listening History Flow

actor User
participant "React SPA" as SPA
participant "API Gateway" as APIGW
participant "Cognito Authorizer" as COG
participant "api_get_myhistory" as HISTORY
database "DynamoDB Listening Events" as EVENTS
database "DynamoDB Tracks" as TRACKS

User -> SPA : Open listening history
SPA -> APIGW : GET /me/listening/history
APIGW -> COG : Validate JWT
COG --> APIGW : Claims with user id
APIGW -> HISTORY : Proxy request
HISTORY -> EVENTS : Query GSI1 by user id
EVENTS --> HISTORY : Listening events
HISTORY -> TRACKS : BatchGet track metadata
TRACKS --> HISTORY : Titles, artists, covers, statuses
HISTORY -> HISTORY : Enrich and sanitize response
HISTORY --> APIGW : History payload
APIGW --> SPA : 200 OK

@enduml